{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25031","headline":"买花谣 · 刘言史","name":"买花谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杜陵村人不田穑，入谷经谿复缘壁。\n每至南山草木春，即向侯家取金碧。\n幽艳凝华春景曙，林夫移得将何处。\n蝶惜芳丛送下山，寻断孤香始回去。\n豪少居连鳷鹊东，千金使买一株红。\n院多花少栽未得，零落绿娥纤指中。\n咸阳亲戚长安里，无限将金买花子。\n浇红湿绿千万家，青丝玉轳声哑哑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘言史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}